'''Goats''' are an enemy added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]''.

Goats usually spawn in large groups and perform attacks depending on the number of other Goats around. When there is only 1 Goat it will chase Isaac and charge, attempting to ram him, if he is to his either side. If there are 2 Goats, one will perform the charge attack, the other will stop when near Isaac to shoot two blood shots in a spread followed by three blood shots in a spread in succession, similar to {{E|Krampus}}. Only 2 Goats can actively attack at one time and all other Goats will attempt to stay away from Isaac but can switch places with an active Goat if Isaac draws near to it.

