'''Black Goats''' act the same as Goats, but shoot three blood shots in a spread followed by four blood shots in a spread in succession, identical to {{E|Krampus}}. Additionally, they also gain the ability to shoot thin {{i|Brimstone}} lasers in the cardinal directions. When one Black Goat performs a {{i|Brimstone}} attack all other Black Goats mimic it and perform the attack even if they were passive and not one of the 2 active goats. If there is only one Black Goat, it still retains the {{i|Brimstone}} in addition to its ramming attack.

